{"watch":21,"start":6000,"events":[{"seq":1070,"t":6000,"type":"watch","watch":21},{"seq":1071,"t":6000,"type":"decode","house":"tiger","letter":"L209","text":"FIR_T FOOT, M_R_H TO NORTH __N_ MI____.","readable":false},{"seq":1072,"t":6000,"type":"model","house":"rhino","model":"local:local","tokens":1807,"retries":0},{"seq":1073,"t":6000,"type":"thought","house":"rhino","text":"It's Watch 21. Doctrine dictates taking the west crossing (F1) early, which should be secured. I must act on captured mail. Kite is moving towards NONG VILLAGE/F1 area (from North Bank West). Orchid is at F1/West Ford. I will move forces to contest the west crossing and respond t"},{"seq":1074,"t":6000,"type":"courier","id":"c338","house":"rhino","letter":"L408","kind":"order","to":"rhino-inf-1","path":["rhino-camp"],"depart":6000,"plain":"FIRST FOOT, MARCH TO WEST FORD.","cipher":null},{"seq":1075,"t":6000,"type":"courier","id":"c339","house":"rhino","letter":"L409","kind":"order","to":"rhino-arch-1","path":["rhino-camp"],"depart":6000,"plain":"BOWMEN, MARCH TO NORTH BANK WEST.","cipher":null},{"seq":1076,"t":6000,"type":"model","house":"kite","model":"local:local","tokens":1813,"retries":0},{"seq":1077,"t":6000,"type":"thought","house":"kite","text":"It is Watch 21/30. Rhino has several units near our fords (F1, F2). My doctrine suggests decoys and double riders. I'll use a decoy to draw attention away from my main defensive posture, while screening my forces around key areas. I'll move my ele towards F2 to reinforce it."},{"seq":1078,"t":6000,"type":"courier","id":"c340","house":"kite","letter":"L410","kind":"order","to":"kite-inf-1","path":["kite-camp","north-village"],"depart":6300,"plain":"FIRST FOOT, HOLD AT NONG VILLAGE.","cipher":"BEQRS BKKS, DKHO TS JKJC VEHHTCN."},{"seq":1079,"t":6000,"type":"courier","id":"c341","house":"kite","letter":"L411","kind":"order","to":"kite-ele-1","path":["kite-camp","north-village","n-mid","n-west"],"depart":6300,"plain":"ELEPHANTS, MARCH TO MIDDLE FORD.","cipher":"NHNMDTJSR, ITQLD SK IEOOHN BKQO."},{"seq":1080,"t":6000,"type":"courier","id":"c342","house":"kite","letter":"L412","kind":"decoy","to":"kite-arch-1","path":["kite-camp","north-village"],"depart":6000,"plain":"BOWMEN, ATTACK AT WEST FORD.","cipher":null},{"seq":1081,"t":6000,"type":"model","house":"orchid","model":"local:local","tokens":1889,"retries":0},{"seq":1082,"t":6000,"type":"thought","house":"orchid","text":"Rhino has units near F1 (n-west, west-ford) and Tiger has units near F1/s-west. I should reinforce F1 with my infantry/archers and prepare to intercept Tiger/Rhino movements based on captured letters. Orchid forces are at F1, but they are static. I will move my main force to F1 t"},{"seq":1083,"t":6000,"type":"courier","id":"c343","house":"orchid","letter":"L413","kind":"order","to":"orchid-inf-2","path":["orchid-camp","s-west","F1"],"depart":6300,"plain":"SECOND FOOT, MARCH TO WEST FORD.","cipher":"RMOKJS AKKT, IBQOD TK WMRT AKQS."},{"seq":1084,"t":6000,"type":"courier","id":"c344","house":"orchid","letter":"L414","kind":"order","to":"orchid-arch-1","path":["orchid-camp","s-west","F1"],"depart":6300,"plain":"BOWMEN, MARCH TO WEST FORD.","cipher":"LKWIMJ, IBQOD TK WMRT AKQS."},{"seq":1085,"t":6000,"type":"model","house":"tiger","model":"local:local","tokens":2082,"retries":0},{"seq":1086,"t":6000,"type":"thought","house":"tiger","text":"Watch 21. Doctrine: Take west ford first 5 watches, hold it, hunt riders. Rhino has units at F1 (West Ford). I should reinforce/maintain presence at F1, using my forces near DHARA VILLAGE (inf/ele) to project power or move towards the west. Tiger Cav is at F2. I need to secure F1"},{"seq":1087,"t":6000,"type":"courier","id":"c345","house":"tiger","letter":"L415","kind":"order","to":"tiger-inf-1","path":["tiger-camp","south-village"],"depart":6000,"plain":"FIRST FOOT, MARCH TO WEST FORD.","cipher":null},{"seq":1088,"t":6000,"type":"courier","id":"c346","house":"tiger","letter":"L416","kind":"order","to":"tig